=== Operational Role

Although developed primarily as an analytical tool, the dashboard also serves as an operational decision-support interface.

Potential use cases include:

- monitoring expected shipment volumes;
- identifying upcoming demand peaks;
- comparing candidate forecasting models;
- supporting transport planning activities;
- analyzing destination-specific trends;
- investigating local demand patterns;
- communicating forecasting results to operational teams.

By providing immediate access to coherent forecasts, the visualization layer reduces the effort required to interpret model outputs and facilitates communication between analytical teams and operational stakeholders.

Furthermore, the use of Altair@altair ensures that visualizations remain reproducible and can easily be integrated into notebooks, reports, or future web-based applications.